From c4fe47a154591e3a5c596c8616f16976ecd2b914 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex PoC <codex-poc@invalid.example>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:14:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/16] Add UnifiedPush notification settings UI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adapt the notification settings controls and navigation from Molly’s UnifiedPush integration for the pinned Signal baseline. Preserve default notification selection until the user chooses a delivery method.

Upstream provenance: Molly commit 4d00414d22f726821f76c3d0e777f7c9ec2c9e0c (sim, UnifiedPush); a688a8d09a5ed40a9d60d9b7d3011757b6dcd398 (sim, QR linking); 0f7438c283f1a761ef9b59fc5df015b33cacf604 (Oscar Mira, notification settings); 55bf67ecaedb31ba767f8866cc22582e85cef60f (Oscar Mira, navigation).

This patch retains the source license headers and attributes the upstream work; it adds no new licensing terms.
